# Transient build directories created by the Template Studio render tests
# (`mkdtemp` under process.cwd()). They are removed in the tests' `finally`, but a
# run that is interrupted (Ctrl+C, timeout) leaves one behind and it then shows up
# as untracked noise in every later `git status`.
.studio-latest-test-*/
.studio-preview-test-*/
.template-editor-*/
